{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》今晚（16日）播出一集「拆彈高手」，劇情講述楊光（侯雋熙飾）加入了唐萬里（吳若希飾）的公關公司「跨世代」，首日上班即闖大禍，得罪了城中名媛Lilian（吳芷默飾），對方誓要向「跨世代」追討賠償，「跨世代」老闆高冠一（容天佑飾）乘機剷除眼中釘。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T13:20:21.981079+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:39:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T00:57:35.205106+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T13:17:46.115778+00:00","content_hash":"d1a6882bcdb94ea66fd40d0f6e27c365e9dc2484c40737e318fa259a0b0caa9a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}